"how_to_restore_body" = "If you recently lost your Snapstreak, you can restore it with one free Snapstreak Restore or with an in-app purchase from the Chat feed or your conversation.\n\nYou can start a new Snapstreak with your friend by sending a Snap back and forth to each other every day (within 24 hours) for three or more consecutive days.\n\n<bold>Please Note:</bold> Snaps sent with Memories or Spectacles content to other Snapchatters do not count towards your Snapstreaks 🥲";
