"trouble_restoring_body" = "You can only restore your Snapstreak for a limited time after it has expired. If you don't see the option to restore your Snapstreak with an in-app purchase, then too much time has passed since the Snapstreak expired and it's no longer eligible for restoration 😔\n\nYou can start a new Snapstreak with your friend by sending a Snap back and forth to each other every day (within 24 hours) for three or more consecutive days.\n\nIf you do see the option to restore your Snapstreak but are having trouble completing the purchase, check out these troubleshooting guides for <link-ios>iOS</link-ios> and <link-android>Android</link-android>.";